WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.458
Telangana Bhu Bharati provides Record of Rights and passbook services. Capture the version you actually viewed.

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:16.542
Match the passbook or khata number. Then check the Pattadar, village, and complete survey subdivision.

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:25.250
Compare extent, history, and any transaction or prohibited-property status with deeds and the land parcel map.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:35.167
A passbook display is one record layer. A disputed claim or restriction needs the competent authority and qualified review.
